evenue-nears-50-billion-ft-says\">FT reported</a> that OpenAI's annualized revenue was closer to $50 billion than the $70 billion everyone was talking about and Oracle (<a href=\"https://seekingalpha.com/symbol/ORCL\" title=\"Oracle Corporation\">ORCL</a></p></body></html>",
